 SG_ WindowPosition_FR : 16|8@1+ (0.4,0) [0|100] "%" Body_Control
 SG_ SunroofPosition : 24|8@1+ (0.4,0) [0|100] "%" Body_Control
 SG_ DoorLockStatus : 32|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" Body_Control
 SG_ ChildLockActive : 36|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Body_Control

BO_ 1280 LightWiper: 8 Light_Module
 SG_ HeadLight : 0|2@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" Body_Control
 SG_ TurnSignal : 2|2@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" Body_Control
 SG_ BrakeLight : 4|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Body_Control
