 SG_ InteriorLight : 56|2@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" Body_Control

BO_ 1536 ChassisData: 8 Chassis_ECU
 SG_ SteeringAngle : 0|16@1- (0.1,0) [-3276.8|3276.7] "deg" Body_Control
 SG_ SteeringTorque : 16|12@1+ (0.01,0) [0|40.95] "Nm" Body_Control
